                    trans_full:             `Full — show the economics, the €14M, and the alternatives you considered and rejected`,
                    trans_headline:         `Headline — the why in plain terms, without the detailed numbers`,
                    trans_minimal:          `Minimal — state the decision, keep the reasoning to management`,
                    r3_sequence_label:      `In what sequence do you communicate?`,
                    seq_cse:                `Works council (CSE) first, then Limoges staff, receiving sites, then external`,
                    seq_allhands:           `A single company-wide all-hands at once, CSE alongside everyone`,
                    seq_press:              `Get ahead of the regional paper — brief the press, then tell staff`,
                    r3_tone_label:          `Set the tone of the all-hands and the message`,
                    tone_clarity:           `Clear & honest — name what is hard, set expectations you can keep`,
                    tone_reassure:          `Reassure — promise no forced redundancies and full redeployment within 30km`,
                    tone_firm:              `Firm & brief — the decision is made, here is what happens`,

                    r4_package_label:       `Design the redeployment & support package for Limoges staff (€M committed)`,
                    r4_package_hint:        `€M for redeployment, retraining and severance. Too little reads as abandonment; spending the whole saving back defeats the consolidation.`,
                    r4_retain_label:        `How do you retain the two key engineers needed for the transfer?`,
                    retain_role:            `Named role + relocation + a stake in leading the transfer`,
                    retain_bonus:           `A retention bonus, no role change discussed`,
