                    r4_evaluate_label:      `How will you know in 60 days whether the process was felt as fair?`,
                    eval_loop:              `A 60-day fairness pulse + CSE review + tracked support-package delivery`,
                    eval_informal:          `Informal check-ins by managers, no formal measure`,
                    eval_none:              `Decided and communicated — the process is done`,
                    r4_customer_label:      `The aerospace customer asks if supply is at risk. You:`,
                    cust_evidence:          `Share the transfer plan and the retained engineers as evidence of continuity`,
                    cust_silence:           `Say nothing until the plant is fully transferred`,
